    "text": "<p>Given that:<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder accentunder=\"false\"><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></munder><mo>&#8202;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8658;</mo><munder accentunder=\"false\"><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></munder><mo>&#8202;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8658;</mo><munder accentunder=\"false\"><mo>lim</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8734;</mi></mrow></munder><mo>&#8202;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8722;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><msqrt><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8658;</mo><mtext>&#160;Limit exist only If&#16